#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:5
msgid "Prefix-Cache Aware Routing"
msgstr "前缀缓存感知路由"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:7
msgid ""
"Many LLM requests share a long prompt prefix: a system prompt, a shared "
"document, or the earlier turns of a conversation. An engine that has "
"already processed that prefix still holds its KV cache blocks, so it can "
"skip most of the prefill work. Prefix-cache aware routing sends each "
"request to a pod that already holds the longest matching prefix. This "
"lowers time to first token and saves GPU compute."
msgstr ""
"许多 LLM 请求共享很长的 prompt 前缀：系统提示词、共享文档，或对话中此前的轮次。已经处理过该前缀的引擎仍保留着对应的 KVCache "
"块，因此可以跳过大部分 prefill 工作。前缀缓存感知路由会把每个请求发送到已持有最长匹配前缀的 Pod，从而降低首 token "
"延迟（TTFT）并节省 GPU 算力。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``prefix-cache`` strategy is built into the AIBrix gateway. In its "
"default mode it needs no changes to your engines, but each engine must "
"have its own prefix caching enabled for the routing to pay off."
msgstr ""
"``prefix-cache`` 策略内置于 AIBrix 网关。在默认模式下，它无需改动引擎，但每个引擎必须自行启用前缀缓存（prefix "
"caching），路由才能发挥作用。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:16
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:18
msgid "For each request, the gateway does the following:"
msgstr "对每个请求，网关会执行以下步骤："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:20
msgid ""
"Builds the prompt text. For chat requests this is the message text, "
"preceded by the request's ``tools`` when present (see "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_INCLUDE_TOOLS``)."
msgstr ""
"构建 prompt 文本。对于聊天请求，这是消息文本；如果请求带有 ``tools`` ，则 ``tools`` 会放在消息文本之前（见 "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_INCLUDE_TOOLS`` ）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:21
msgid ""
"Tokenizes the text and splits the result into fixed-size blocks. Each "
"block's hash includes the hash of the block before it, so a block matches"
" only when everything before it matches too. A trailing partial block is "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"对文本做 "
"tokenize，并把结果切分为固定大小的块。每个块的哈希都包含前一个块的哈希，因此只有在它之前的所有内容都匹配时，该块才会匹配。末尾不足一块的部分会被忽略。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:22
msgid ""
"Looks the blocks up in a per-model prefix index, in order, and stops at "
"the first block that no ready pod holds. A pod's prefix match is the "
"percentage of the request's blocks, counted from the start, that it "
"holds."
msgstr "按顺序在按模型划分的前缀索引中查找这些块，遇到没有任何就绪 Pod 持有的块时停止。Pod 的前缀匹配度是它从头开始持有的请求块所占的百分比。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:23
msgid ""
"Chooses a pod from the prefix match and the pods' load, as described in "
":ref:`Choosing the pod <prefix_cache_choosing_pod>`."
msgstr "根据前缀匹配度和各 Pod 的负载选择 Pod，详见 :ref:`选择 Pod <prefix_cache_choosing_pod>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:24
msgid ""
"Records the chosen pod as holding the request's blocks, so later requests"
" with the same prefix follow it."
msgstr "把所选 Pod 记录为持有该请求的块，使之后具有相同前缀的请求跟随到该 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:27
msgid "Routing modes"
msgstr "路由模式"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:33
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:34
msgid "Prefix index"
msgstr "前缀索引"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:35
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:36
msgid "Standard (default)"
msgstr "标准模式（默认）"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:37
msgid ""
"A hash table in each gateway replica. A pod is added to it each time the "
"gateway routes a prefix to that pod."
msgstr "每个网关副本内的哈希表。每当网关把某个前缀路由到某个 Pod，就会把该 Pod 加入索引。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:38
msgid ""
"Works with any engine and needs no extra setup. The index reflects where "
"the gateway sent requests, not what the engine still has cached, so it "
"can lag behind cache evictions in the engine."
msgstr "适用于任何引擎，无需额外配置。索引反映的是网关把请求发到了哪里，而不是引擎当前实际缓存了什么，因此可能滞后于引擎侧的缓存淘汰。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:39
msgid "KV event sync"
msgstr "KV Cache 事件同步"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:40
msgid ""
"An index fed by the engines' own block-stored and block-removed events. "
"Enabled with ``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_KV_EVENT_SYNC_ENABLED=true``."
msgstr ""
"由引擎自身的块写入和块移除事件驱动的索引。通过 "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_KV_EVENT_SYNC_ENABLED=true`` 启用。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:41
msgid ""
"Follows the real cache state of each engine. It requires engines that "
"publish KV cache events and turns on the remote tokenizer automatically. "
"See :doc:`../scaling-performance/kv-event-sync`."
msgstr ""
"跟随各引擎真实的缓存状态。它要求引擎发布 KVCache 事件，并会自动启用 remote tokenizer。参见 :doc"
":`../scaling-performance/kv-event-sync` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:43
msgid "Both modes use the same pod selection."
msgstr "两种模式使用相同的 Pod 选择方式。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:46
msgid "Enabling the strategy"
msgstr "启用该策略"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:48
msgid "Select it for a single request with the ``routing-strategy`` header:"
msgstr "通过 ``routing-strategy`` 请求头为单个请求选择该策略："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:63
msgid ""
"To make it the default for a model, set ``routingStrategy`` in the "
"model's config profile (see :ref:`config_profiles`), or set the gateway's"
" ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` environment variable to ``prefix-cache``. See :doc"
":`gateway-plugins` for the order in which these apply."
msgstr ""
"要让它成为某个模型的默认策略，请在该模型的 config profile 中设置 ``routingStrategy`` （见 "
":ref:`config_profiles` ），或把网关的 ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` 环境变量设为 ``prefix-"
"cache`` 。这些方式的生效顺序见 :doc:`gateway-plugins` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:68
msgid "Choosing the pod"
msgstr "选择 Pod"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:70
msgid ""
"By default the gateway does not route on prefix match alone. It scores "
"every ready pod on two signals, normalizes each score to the range 0 to "
"1, and sends the request to the pod with the highest weighted total:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，网关不会只根据前缀匹配度路由。它会在两个信号上为每个就绪 Pod 打分，把每个分数归一化到 0 到 1 "
"的范围，并把请求发送到加权总分最高的 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:72
msgid "the pod's prefix match, with weight 5, and"
msgstr "Pod 的前缀匹配度，权重为 5；以及"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:73
msgid "the pod's capacity-aware ``load-balance`` score, with weight 4."
msgstr "Pod 的容量感知 ``load-balance`` 得分，权重为 4。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:75
msgid ""
"The weights lean toward cache affinity, but load still counts, so the pod"
" with the best prefix match does not always win. Before any strategy "
"runs, the gateway's load-imbalance gate can also narrow the candidates "
"when load across the pods is severely skewed."
msgstr ""
"这些权重偏向缓存亲和，但负载仍会起作用，因此前缀匹配度最高的 Pod 并不总是胜出。在任何策略运行之前，当各 Pod "
"之间的负载严重倾斜时，网关的负载不均衡门控还可能缩小候选范围。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:77
msgid ""
"If you disable the blend by setting "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT=0``, ``prefix-cache`` "
"routes by itself:"
msgstr ""
"如果通过设置 ``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT=0`` 关闭混合， "
"``prefix-cache`` 会独立路由："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:79
msgid ""
"It sorts the pods that hold a match by prefix match, highest first, and "
"then by running requests, fewest first."
msgstr "它先按前缀匹配度从高到低、再按运行中请求数从少到多，对持有匹配的 Pod 排序。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:80
msgid ""
"It picks the first pod whose running requests are no higher than ``mean +"
" factor × σ``, where the mean and the standard deviation σ are taken over"
" the candidate pods and ``factor`` is "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR``."
msgstr ""
"它选择第一个运行中请求数不高于 ``mean + factor × σ`` 的 Pod，其中均值和标准差 σ 取自候选 Pod， "
"``factor`` 为 ``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:81
msgid ""
"If no pod holds a match, or none passes the threshold, it falls back to "
"the pod with the fewest running requests."
msgstr "如果没有 Pod 持有匹配，或没有 Pod 通过阈值，则回退到运行中请求数最少的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:83
msgid ""
"``prefix-cache-preble`` is a separate strategy that weighs prefix hits "
"against load using the Preble cost model. See :doc:`gateway-plugins` for "
"all strategies."
msgstr ""
"``prefix-cache-preble`` 是另一个独立策略，它基于 Preble 成本模型权衡前缀命中和负载。所有策略见 :doc"
":`gateway-plugins` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:86
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:88
msgid ""
"Set these variables on the gateway plugin deployment. The defaults are "
"the built-in ones."
msgstr "在网关插件的 Deployment 上设置这些变量。默认值为内置默认值。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:94
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:95
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:96
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:97
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_TOKENIZER_TYPE``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_TOKENIZER_TYPE``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:98
msgid "``character``"
msgstr "``character``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:99
msgid ""
"Local tokenizer: ``character`` (the UTF-8 bytes of the text) or "
"``tiktoken``."
msgstr "本地 tokenizer： ``character`` （文本的 UTF-8 字节）或 ``tiktoken`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:100
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_BLOCK_SIZE``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_BLOCK_SIZE``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:101
msgid "``4``"
msgstr "``4``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:102
msgid ""
"Size of a prefix block, in bytes of the tokenized prompt. With "
"``tiktoken`` each token counts as 4 bytes. Smaller blocks match finer "
"prefixes but create more blocks to hash and store."
msgstr ""
"前缀块的大小，单位为 tokenize 后 prompt 的字节数。使用 ``tiktoken`` 时，每个 token 计为 4 "
"字节。块越小，匹配的前缀越精细，但需要哈希和存储的块也越多。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:103
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_BLOCK_NUMBER``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_BLOCK_NUMBER``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:104
msgid "``200000``"
msgstr "``200000``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:105
msgid ""
"Maximum number of blocks in the index. The least recently updated blocks "
"are evicted first."
msgstr "索引中块的最大数量。最久未更新的块最先被淘汰。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:106
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_EVICTION_DURATION_MINS``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_EVICTION_DURATION_MINS``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:107
msgid "``20``"
msgstr "``20``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:108
msgid ""
"A block that has not been refreshed for this long expires. A block is "
"refreshed each time the gateway routes a request that contains it. The same "
"duration applies to each pod within a block: a pod that has not been routed "
"the block for this long no longer counts as a match, even while the block "
"stays cached for other pods."
msgstr ""
"超过该时长未被刷新的块会过期。每当网关路由包含某个块的请求时，该块就会被刷新。"
"同一时长也适用于块内的每个 Pod：超过该时长未被路由到该块的 Pod 不再计为匹配，"
"即使该块仍因其他 Pod 而保留在缓存中。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:109
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:110
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:125
msgid "``1``"
msgstr "``1``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:111
msgid ""
"The ``factor`` in the standalone selection above. A model config profile "
"can override it per request with "
"``routingConfig.prefixCache.standardDeviationFactor``."
msgstr ""
"上述独立选择中的 ``factor`` 。Model config profile 可以通过 "
"``routingConfig.prefixCache.standardDeviationFactor`` 按请求覆盖它。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:112
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_INCLUDE_TOOLS``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_INCLUDE_TOOLS``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:113
msgid "``true``"
msgstr "``true``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:114
msgid ""
"Include the chat request's ``tools`` in the hashed text, so requests with"
" the same messages but different tools do not look like a full match."
msgstr "把聊天请求的 ``tools`` 纳入被哈希的文本，使消息相同但 tools 不同的请求不会被当作完全匹配。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:115
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_USE_REMOTE_TOKENIZER``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_USE_REMOTE_TOKENIZER``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:116
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:119
msgid "``false``"
msgstr "``false``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:117
msgid ""
"Tokenize with the engines' own tokenizer service instead of a local "
"tokenizer."
msgstr "使用引擎自带的 tokenizer 服务，而不是本地 tokenizer 进行 tokenize。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:118
msgid "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_KV_EVENT_SYNC_ENABLED``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_KV_EVENT_SYNC_ENABLED``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:120
msgid "Use KV event sync mode."
msgstr "使用 KV 事件同步模式。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:121
msgid ""
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_PREFIX_CACHE_WEIGHT`` and "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_PREFIX_CACHE_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT``"
msgstr ""
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_PREFIX_CACHE_WEIGHT`` 和 "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_PREFIX_CACHE_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:122
msgid "``5`` and ``4``"
msgstr "``5`` 和 ``4``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:123
msgid ""
"The weights of the prefix match and of ``load-balance`` in the default "
"blend."
msgstr "默认混合中，前缀匹配度和 ``load-balance`` 的权重。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:124
msgid "``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT``"
msgstr "``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:126
msgid "Set to ``0`` to turn the auto-blend off."
msgstr "设为 ``0`` 可关闭自动混合。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:128
msgid ""
"The gateway manifest shipped in ``config/gateway/gateway-plugin`` sets "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_BLOCK_SIZE`` to ``128`` and "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR`` to ``2``, so a default "
"installation runs with those values."
msgstr ""
"``config/gateway/gateway-plugin`` 中随附的网关清单把 "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_BLOCK_SIZE`` 设为 ``128`` ，把 "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_STANDARD_DEVIATION_FACTOR`` 设为 ``2`` ，因此默认安装使用这些值。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:131
msgid "Things to know"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:133
msgid ""
"In standard mode the index is an estimate built from the gateway's own "
"routing decisions. Use KV event sync if you need it to follow the "
"engines' real cache state."
msgstr "在标准模式下，索引是根据网关自身路由决策构建的估计值。如果需要索引跟随引擎的真实缓存状态，请使用 KV 事件同步。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:134
msgid ""
"Each gateway replica keeps its own index. With "
"``AIBRIX_STATESYNC_ENABLED=true`` the replicas share it through Redis, "
"which they sync periodically, so they converge over time. The replicas "
"then also use the same hash seed (``0`` unless you set "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_HASH_SEED``)."
msgstr ""
"每个网关副本都有自己的索引。设置 ``AIBRIX_STATESYNC_ENABLED=true`` 后，各副本通过 Redis "
"共享索引并定期同步，因此会逐渐趋于一致。此时各副本也会使用相同的哈希种子（除非设置了 "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_HASH_SEED`` ，否则为 ``0`` ）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:135
msgid ""
"The index is kept per model name. In standard mode it is bounded by the "
"block limit and the expiry time above."
msgstr "索引按模型名称划分。在标准模式下，它受上述块数量上限和过期时间限制。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:136
msgid "A prompt prefix shorter than one block cannot match."
msgstr "短于一个块的 prompt 前缀无法匹配。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:139
msgid "Observability"
msgstr "可观测性"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:141
msgid "The strategy exports these Prometheus metrics:"
msgstr "该策略导出以下 Prometheus 指标："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:143
msgid "``aibrix_prefix_cache_routing_decisions_total``, by prefix-match bucket"
msgstr "``aibrix_prefix_cache_routing_decisions_total`` ，按前缀匹配度分桶"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/prefix-cache-aware-routing.rst:144
msgid ""
"``aibrix_prefix_cache_routing_selection_total``, by outcome: "
"``prefix_match``, ``prefix_match_skipped`` or ``least_request_fallback``"
msgstr ""
